# Exceptions to the dependency freshness gate (scripts/deps-fresh.sh).
#
# One entry per line:
#
#   <go|cargo> <name> <expires YYYY-MM-DD> <reason>
#
# name is the module path exactly as go.mod requires it, or the crates.io
# crate name. The entry lets that dependency stay behind its latest major
# until the end of the expiry day (UTC); after that the gate fails until the
# dependency is upgraded or the entry is renewed with a new date and reason.
# Keep expiries short (weeks, not years) and say what the upgrade waits for,
# with a link to the upstream issue where there is one. An entry that matches
# no lagging dependency prints a warning: remove it.
#
# Example:
#
#   cargo rcgen 2027-01-31 waits for x509-parser 0.18 support, https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/issues/<n>
